                            "The plain lantern\nlens costs less\nthan the colored\nset. The clerk",
                            "chose it because a\nsignal should be\nreadable without\nnaming colors.",
                            "The unused lenses\ndecorate the tea\nshelf. Their\nbeauty has found a",
